OL,3,GNEWSAMajor gangland figure Steven
OL,4,ADaniel charged after organised crime
OL,5,Araid
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of Scotland's most high-profile
OL,8,Fgangland figures has been arrested and
OL,9,Fcharged following an early morning
OL,10,Fpolice raid.
OL,12,FSteven 'Bonzo' Daniel, 46 was taken
OL,13,Finto custody at around 06:00 from his
OL,14,Fhome in Robroyston in the north of
OL,15,FGlasgow.
OL,17,FDaniel is understood to be the head of
OL,18,Fthe notorious Daniel crime family which
OL,19,Fhas been engaged in a violent feud with
OL,20,Fthe rival Lyons family for 25 years.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
