OL,3,GNEWSAMajor gangland figure Steven
OL,4,ADaniel charged after organised crime
OL,5,Araid
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was charged in connection with
OL,8,Fserious and organised crime, firearms
OL,9,Fand drugs offences as part of Operation
OL,10,FVentetic, a major UK-wide operation
OL,11,Fwhich has dismantled several gangs.
